      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "面试先避坑\n不是 sparse attention，也不是 low-rank 近似\n时间复杂度仍是 O(N^2 d)\n显存占用从存 N^2 中间矩阵转向 O(Nd)\n优势来自 IO-aware kernel fusion 和 tiling",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "面试先避坑\n不是 sparse attention，也不是 low-rank 近似\n时间复杂度仍是 O(N^2 d)\n显存占用从存 N^2 中间矩阵转向 O(Nd)\n优势来自 IO-aware kernel fusion 和 tiling",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
