      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "瓶颈：v1 还没接近 GEMM，occupancy 和 warp 通信不理想\n核心：跨 thread block 并行单个 head\nwarp 内重新分工，减少 shared memory 往返\n面试句：算法思想不变，主要优化 work partitioning",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "瓶颈：v1 还没接近 GEMM，occupancy 和 warp 通信不理想\n核心：跨 thread block 并行单个 head\nwarp 内重新分工，减少 shared memory 往返\n面试句：算法思想不变，主要优化 work partitioning",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
