      "text": "Q7 什么时候收益最大？",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Q7 什么时候收益最大？",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qa7-a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1293,
      "y": 854,
      "width": 465,
      "height": 18.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "seed": 1064,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "长序列、大 batch 或显存带宽敏感时最明显；很短序列、特殊 mask 或不支持硬件时收益会变小。",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "长序列、大 batch 或显存带宽敏感时最明显；很短序列、特殊 mask 或不支持硬件时收益会变小。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
